    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"contextual_flattening\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"The excerpts show no meaningful contextual differences in policy debate.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_0c2c78f47e3df18d\",\"quote\":\"We are still learning about Ebola and the efficacy of the screening processes. What discussions has the Secretary of State had with other European countries…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_db7cbc689793f6b5\",\"quote\":\"I have spoken to several European Health Ministers…no one country can solve this on its own…we collaborate well with others…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_698e587c8b2489f7\",\"quote\":\"I declare an interest… PHE staff will appreciate the Secretary of State’s calm and supportive words…local directors of public health…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_2dba5ae2a40a1973\",\"quote\":\"Every local area has had a resilience exercise…we have been satisfied with the response…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_698e587c8b2489f7\",\"quote\":\"is the Secretary of State confident that they still have the resources and organisational support…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_db7cbc689793f6b5\",\"quote\":\"the Under-Secretary of State for Health, my hon. Friend the Member for Battersea (Jane Ellison)…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_0c2c78f47e3df18d\",\"quote\":\"…ensure a comprehensive approach?\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"whole_packet_no_support\",\"mechanism\":\"The excerpts explicitly detail conversations and collaborations between the Secretary of State and European health ministers, demonstrating significant contextual differences in the policy debate regarding Ebola response.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim ignores the documented exchanges regarding international cooperation and resource allocation, presenting a misleading picture of a uniform approach.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The evidence demonstrates a highly contextualized debate, reflecting diverse national responses and collaborative efforts.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The claim falsely asserts the absence of meaningful contextual differences. The provided excerpts reveal extensive discussions and collaborations among international stakeholders, directly contradicting the claim's assertion.\"}",
